<metadata><name>Snowlands 1041 Forestdale Divide Loop</name><desc>lollipop (stem back from waypoint 2). 7.4 miles round trip. Line traced from Marcus Libkind's map, tours.snowlands.org/tours/10/1041_tour.htm</desc></metadata>
